    </div>

    <div class="row g-4">
      <div class="col-md-4">
        <div class="clinical-card h-100 border-start border-4 border-success">
          <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between mb-3">
            <span class="risk-badge Low">Low Risk</span>
            <span class="text-success fw-bold">Tier 1</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="h5 fw-bold text-dark">Adequate Nutritional Health</h3>
          <p class="text-muted small mb-3">
            Nutritional intake, dietary diversity scores, and anthropometric metrics are balanced. 
            No acute clinical or socioeconomic vulnerabilities are present.
          </p>
          <div class="p-2 bg-light rounded text-muted small">
            <strong>Recommended Action:</strong> Routine periodic health monitoring; maintenance of current dietary diversity.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-md-4">
        <div class="clinical-card h-100 border-start border-4 border-warning">
          <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between mb-3">
            <span class="risk-badge Moderate">Moderate Risk</span>
            <span class="text-warning fw-bold">Tier 2</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="h5 fw-bold text-dark">Emerging Nutritional Vulnerability</h3>
          <p class="text-muted small mb-3">
            Sub-optimal indicators present, such as monotonous food groups, low meal frequency, 
            recent acute illness, or socioeconomic barriers.
          </p>
          <div class="p-2 bg-light rounded text-muted small">
            <strong>Recommended Action:</strong> Nutritional counseling, dietary diversification plan, follow-up screening in 3 months.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-md-4">
        <div class="clinical-card h-100 border-start border-4 border-danger">
          <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between mb-3">
