            <span class="text-danger fw-bold">Tier 3</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="h5 fw-bold text-dark">Acute Malnutrition Susceptibility</h3>
          <p class="text-muted small mb-3">
            High probability of undernutrition or severe metabolic strain driven by combined anthropometric deficits, 
            extreme dietary insufficiency, illness, and poverty.
          </p>
          <div class="p-2 bg-light rounded text-muted small">
            <strong>Recommended Action:</strong> Prompt clinical evaluation by a medical practitioner or specialized dietitian.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

